### SCENARIO: HCM rejects approval due to balance drift
### The local DB shows emp-3 with 7 effective days,
### but HCM only has 2 effective days (balance changed externally).
### Prerequisites: run 01-seed-balances.http first, mock HCM running on :3001

### Step 1: Verify local balance — shows 7 effective days
GET http://localhost:3000/balances/emp-3/loc-nyc

### Step 2: Create a 5-day request — passes local validation (7 >= 5)
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-3",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "VACATION",
  "startDate": "2026-05-01",
  "endDate": "2026-05-07",
  "days": 5,
  "reason": "Long vacation",
  "idempotencyKey": "drift-001"
}

### Step 3: Try to approve — HCM rejects! (replace REQUEST_ID)
# Expected: 422 HCM_VALIDATION_ERROR
# HCM only has 2 effective days (10 available - 8 used)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/requests/{{REQUEST_ID}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewerNote": "Looks good to me"
}

### Step 4: Request should still be PENDING (can retry later)
GET http://localhost:3000/requests?employeeId=emp-3&status=PENDING
